# judge_v3 gap probes (n5-v3)

P1-g2-repeated-registered-name: DEFECT REPRODUCED
  claim   : G2 rejects a registered character's name outside the matched fact span even though the mention adds no event
  text    : 管线甲从管线镇来到了钟楼。管线甲把铜铃挂回了钟楼。管线甲在窗边站定，望着远处的塔尖，没有说话。
  desired : pass
  gates   : {"G1_alignment": true, "G2_residue": false, "G3_time": true, "G6_no_truncation": true}
  problems: ['residue-name:管线甲', 'residue-name:管线甲']

P2-g2-scope-unregistered-name: DEFECT REPRODUCED
  claim   : G2 does not look at names that are not in the registry, so an invented actor is invisible to the hard gates (D4/N6 must catch it)
  text    : 王五站在门口，看着管线甲把铜铃挂回了钟楼。
  desired : reject
  gates   : {"G1_alignment": true, "G2_residue": true, "G3_time": true, "G6_no_truncation": true}
  problems: []

P3-g1-negated-result: DEFECT REPRODUCED
  claim   : G1 accepts a negated result because up to 8 characters may sit between the subject and the result text
  text    : 管线甲并未把铜铃挂回了钟楼，他只是站在楼梯口看了一会儿。
  desired : reject
  gates   : {"G1_alignment": true, "G2_residue": true, "G3_time": true, "G6_no_truncation": true}
  problems: []

P4-g1-hedged-result: DEFECT REPRODUCED
