  text    : 管线甲差点就把铜铃挂回了钟楼，手抖了一下又缩了回去。
  desired : reject
  gates   : {"G1_alignment": true, "G2_residue": true, "G3_time": true, "G6_no_truncation": true}
  problems: []

P5-g1-observer-attribution: DEFECT REPRODUCED
